  Student[Student] -->|details and complaint| Reception[Reception intake]
  Reception -->|submitted intake| Queue[(Clinic intake and history)]
  Queue --> Nurse[Nurse review and scheduling]
  Nurse -->|doctor and appointment| Appointments[(Appointments)]
