  Doctor --> Records[(Visits and clinical records)]
  Records -->|approved summary and prescription| Student
  Charge[Doctor-in-Charge] --> Queue
  Charge --> Staff[(Staff accounts)]
  Reception --> Audit[(Audit log)]
  Nurse --> Audit
  Doctor --> Audit
  Charge --> Audit
